{
  "id": "sec.health.blood-bank",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": {
    "en": "Blood centre: donation, testing and transfusion",
    "hi": "रक्त केंद्र: दान, परीक्षण एवं आधान"
  },
  "domain": "Healthcare",
  "description": "Donation: donor screening and deferral, collection, mandatory TTI tests (HIV, HBV, HCV, syphilis, malaria), release to inventory or discard. Transfusion: request, grouping and cross-match, issue, bedside identity check, monitoring, reaction reported to haemovigilance (HvPI) (Drugs and Cosmetics Rules Part XII-B, NBTC guidelines).",
